 large following.<br><br>Rivera's photograph showed a landscape scene. In the new artwork, Martinez changed the colors of Rivera's photograph and added text over it.\n <br><br>Martinez sold prints of this new collage for $500 each.\n<br><br>Martinez did not ask Rivera for permission or offer any payment. <br><br>When Rivera objected, Martinez stated that the new artwork was different enough from the original photograph that it should be legally protected as \"fair use.\"\n<br><br>Regardless, Martinez's artwork was displayed in a gallery.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Small - Famous","QuestionID":"QID6","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Alex Martinez\u00a0is a relatively unknown visual artist who primarily shows work at small local galle...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6kXUb6tiH3Chlgq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"HarmTiming","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":20,"MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":40,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID60"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6kXUb6tiH3Chlgq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID61","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"StatusTiming","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configurat